Brand architecture shows how all your names relate, so people never get confused.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. List every entity, programme and product name.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Choose branded house, endorsed or house of brands.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Check names in every language before registering.

6
